### 회원가입 성공 (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@mail.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "nickname": "test"
}

### 같은 이메일로 다시 가입 (409 DUPLICATE_EMAIL) — 위 요청을 먼저 실행
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@mail.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "nickname": "test2"
}

### 이메일 형식 오류 (400 INVALID_INPUT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "nickname": "test"
}

### 비밀번호가 짧음 (400 INVALID_INPUT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "short@mail.com",
  "password": "Pw0!",
  "nickname": "test"
}

### 비밀번호에 한글 포함 (400 INVALID_INPUT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "korean@mail.com",
  "password": "비밀번호Pw0!",
  "nickname": "test"
}

### 비밀번호에 특수문자 없음 (400 INVALID_INPUT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nospecial@mail.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd1234",
  "nickname": "test"
}

### GET은 허용되지 않음 (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
